     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The place values are powers of 5 in base 5.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{2304_5} = 2 \\times {5^3} + 3 \\times {5^2} + 0 \\times {5^1} + 4 \\times {5^0}\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"2 \\times 125 + 3 \\times 25 + 0 \\times 5 + 4 \\times 1\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"250 + 75 + 0 + 4\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"329\"></span></p>"
    },
    {
